1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
You messed up.
…but do you know WHY?

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Practising alone, every tool stops your playing.
Apps grade notes; a teacher tells you the cause, for weekly money.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
So we built a teacher that lives in your signal chain.
NEVER PUT THE GUITAR DOWN

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Guitar in. Camera on. One footswitch. That’s it.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Player: "My G to C change."
Riff: "Got it."

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:44,000
I listen with Ears… watch your hand with Eyes…
and that ___ ms gap? Your strumming hand froze right at the change.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:56,000
I set up the drill,
but I never touch your sound until you approve. [HOLD TO APPROVE]

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Next take: ___ ms. Look at that.
BEFORE ___ ms → AFTER ___ ms

9
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:16,000
And next session, I remember where we left off.
[NEXT TIME: G to C transition]

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Pinch to shape your tone.
Unplug the camera, and the music keeps going.

11
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Real-time audio engine, hand tracking,
and a LangChain deep agent with subagents, skills, and memory.

12
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:36,000
OmniRiff. Never put the guitar down.
